aeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-25d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"一问才知道，原来是去给刚刚病故的叔母吊丧了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2a6","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2a6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"虽说是叔叔的妻子，我也只不过见过她一面。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-2e7","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-2e7"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"虽然印象上是娇小温柔，不过凭儿时的记忆，更是个洋溢着活泼乐天性格的人。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-33a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-33a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"而且还很年轻。应该才刚刚三十出头吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-36f","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-36f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过她身体本来也就不太好。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-39a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-39a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在癌症晚期已经确认没有治愈的希望以后，就住进了疗养院静静地度过了余生。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-3ed","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-3ed"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……这样啊，去世了啊。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-432","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-432"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「我们不去真的好吗」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-466","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-466"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「他们说让我和哥哥在家里呆着」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-4aa","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-4aa"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「是吗……」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-4d7","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-4d7"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我想应该是不想让加奈看到葬礼之类的过于沉重的东西吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-532","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-532"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「看来，就是今晚也不会回来了吧。那么晚饭就吃外卖好了……」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-57e","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-57e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「给，饭钱」","speaker":"加奈"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-5b3","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-5b3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"应该是母亲留下来的，我接了过来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev341b/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-5e9","target":{"variantId":"paire